ctive, Best in Character)\nPlus a thank-you page.\n\nHOW TO HOST:\n1. Send invitations 2 to 3 weeks ahead and give each guest a character.\n2. A week before, send each guest only their own sheet.\n3. On the night, read the opening, then read 3 clue cards each round. Dinner fits between Rounds 1 and 2.\n4. Everyone fills in Detective Notes, then you read the sealed solution.\nThe host can play too. Fewer than 8 guests? The host guide says which pairs to drop.\n\nTHE CHARACTERS: Ivy (lodge owner), Jasper (ski instructor), Clem (head cook), Rupert (antique dealer), Noelle (lodge singer), Dash (handyman), Marigold (travel writer), Felix (owner&#39;s nephew). All original characters, any guest can play any role.\n\nGOOD TO KNOW:\n- Digital PDF download. Nothing ships. Download from your Etsy Purchases page after checkout, then print at home or at a print shop.\n- Print in color or black and white.\n- For personal use. Not editable; invitations have lines to fill in by hand.\n- Best for adults and teens, about 2 hours.\n\nThis design was created with AI assistance under the creative direction of the seller.", "rich_description": null, "state": "draft", "creation_timestamp": 1792930700, "created_timestamp": 1792930700, "ending_timestamp": 1803561500, "original_creation_timestamp": 1792930700, "last_modified_timestamp": 1792930781, "updated_timestamp": 1792930781, "state_timestamp": 1792930700, "quantity": 999, "shop_section_id": null, "featured_rank": -1, "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/4602816114/christmas-murder-mystery-party-game-for", "num_favorers": 0, "non_taxable": false, "is_taxable": true, "is_customizable": false, "is_personalizable": false, "listing_type": "download", "tags": ["murder mystery game", "xmas murder mystery", "murder mystery party", "christmas party game", "whodunit game", "dinner party game", "murder mystery kit", "family xmas game", "mystery dinner party", "holiday party game", "adult party game", "office party game", "printable party game"],